  "split_loader_requirements_before_code": [
    "A model metadata overlay for deepseek4.expert_used_count=4 and ffn_gate_tid2eid.weight dims [4,129280], not just a small expert pack.",
    "A tensor resolver that can source tensors from at least two deterministic local byte providers, preserving GGUF alignment, tensor metadata, mmap/direct-read semantics, and cgroup page-cache accounting.",
