  "why_not_diskless_remote_range_now": [
    "The full 4Expert expert payload is about 145.125 GiB; fetching it on demand over network would move the disk bottleneck to network and make TTFT/reproducibility worse.",
    "The non-expert payload is still about 8.046 GiB, larger than current free disk, and header-only metadata cannot prove it can be replaced by native bytes.",
